WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.442
Drawing Takeoff  ·  Worked example

00:00:00.442 --> 00:00:02.600
A-01 · Locate the 4 m opening between the kitchen and living room on the calibrated plan.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.997
Choose Steel → Post. Place a post at each jamb of the opening.

00:00:05.997 --> 00:00:12.263
Choose Beam and snap its two ends to posts P01 and P02.

00:00:12.263 --> 00:00:15.200
Set Floor only with a 2.0 kPa imposed load. Change the first contributing span to 2 m.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.328
Use recommended sizing, restrict the section family to PFC, then apply the changes.

00:00:18.328 --> 00:00:23.953
Calculate the project to update the section, span and reactions to both posts.

00:00:23.953 --> 00:00:27.214
B01 · 125 PFC over 4.00 m. The plan shows dead and live reactions at both posts.

00:00:27.214 --> 00:00:30.709
Sizing screens deflection. The engineer must still verify strength, stability, connections and supports.
